https://github.com/bearlike/Assistant # Enterprise agent stack without an Android APK download; one of many equivalent AI harnesses.
https://github.com/SplinchGit/Junction # Another on-device AI assistant with unclear licensing and only a direct-APK download.
https://github.com/sue1231513/orangechat # RikkaHub-based AI companion where Shizuku only reads Gadgetbridge data; Chinese-heavy docs.
https://github.com/Quor-a/ZorvAI # Another Chinese-heavy on-device AI agent duplicating listed AI harnesses.
https://github.com/838288383838383/anytool # Generic debloat/tweak/terminal multi-tool with no releases page and placeholder screenshots.
https://github.com/DSH-APP/DSHA # DeepSeek-Harness on-Android launcher; Shizuku is only an optional bridge and agent harnesses abound.
https://github.com/freroxx/toolz # Generic productivity/media/PDF/sensor utility bundle; textbook equivalent-toolbox case.
https://github.com/Xiaonan-520/android_toolbox # Generic Flutter system toolbox; countless equivalent Shizuku toolboxes already exist.
https://github.com/Horizon-25/Game-Booster # Generic Shizuku game booster with no download, no license; countless equivalents.
https://github.com/sbxjtyes/Aether # Another local AI-agent app (non-original queue group); masses of equivalents already.
https://github.com/AceGuru-mjh/Android-Guru-Agent # Another on-device AI agent; no license and no releases on top.
https://github.com/qazmko72/android-mcp-server # Another on-device MCP AI harness; Shizuku only optional app management with many listed AI-agent alternatives.
https://github.com/willygailo/Game-Launcher # Another refresh-rate and CPU booster with hype marketing; many game-booster equivalents exist.
https://github.com/davidyehuda45-byte/huawei-game-tuner # Generic Huawei FPS and resolution booster with Indonesian-only docs and no license.
https://github.com/Undefined-Invalid-Null/UIN-Tool # AI-built DexClassLoader Termux plugin toolbox with Chinese-primary docs and no releases.
https://github.com/ShuRuMingZi1145/Api-Tool # Chinese-only AI IDE/agent harness with only optional Shizuku code-run boost; many AI-agent equivalents exist.
https://github.com/dphmoblie/deepseek-harness-android # DeepSeek Harness Ubuntu-wrapper AI harness where Shizuku is only an optional device-shell side feature.
https://github.com/DeveshTone/Dexor # DEX2OAT/AOT manager duplicating listed AppBooster (same cmd package compile via Shizuku).
https://github.com/maneskinleon-del/GameBoosterManu # Spanish-only Free-Fire-oriented game booster via Shizuku; game-booster category already over-supplied.
https://github.com/elthebestdevelopman-cyber/XiaoHyperCleaner # MIUI analytics/ad remover duplicating listed FxxkMIUIAd; CC BY-NC-SA license is non-free.
https://github.com/codyps/CellScope # Battery-telemetry recorder where Shizuku is only an optional sysfs path; BatStats/Battery-Monitor already listed.
https://github.com/Assangejulian/Muse_Android # Another accessibility-plus-Shizuku phone-control agent with no Releases/license; OpenDroid/Muse/EterUee cover it.
https://github.com/Sanuu7/AndroidHarness # Another on-device AI coding-agent harness (early alpha, no releases); many equivalent agents already listed.
https://github.com/hari161008/Ever-Call-Recorder # Shizuku call-recorder duplicate of listed ShizuCallRecorder; instructs users to replace official Shizuku with a fork.
https://github.com/hosizoraru/KeiOS # Grab-bag toolbox (system utils, GitHub tracking, BA content) with many equivalents; vague scope despite 2400+ files.
https://github.com/lyracode-app/Lyra-Code # AI full-stack dev harness (PRoot/Termux/agent) duplicating many listed AI agents; no releases published.
https://github.com/wkbin/taixu # Another AI agent harness / no-root Linux runtime; many equivalent agents and terminals already listed.
https://github.com/niki914/zafiro # Mature BYOK AI phone-control agent, but one of many equivalent agent harnesses already listed.
https://github.com/AgentKosticka/EasierSpot # BLE hotspot-sharing app duplicating the already-listed EasySpot with the same Apple-Continuity pitch.
https://github.com/aaditagrawal/ophoner # On-device AI phone agent harness duplicating many listed agents; no published release.
https://github.com/hari161008/Ever-Dialer # Another call-recorder/dialer; call recording via Shizuku already covered by listed ShizuCallRecorder.
https://github.com/NanoMindExplorer/GameMapperMind # Another keymapper/gamepad mapper; keymapping already covered by listed KeyMapper, keysync and XtMapper.
https://github.com/xjyzs/Operator-on-Android # Another on-device VLM agent harness with thin Shizuku use; equivalents Open-AutoGLM and Ruto-GLM already listed.
https://github.com/teoplaydor/Unlock # Another Shizuku debloater and app manager; equivalents Hail, Canta and App Manager already listed, no license or releases.
https://github.com/antinormies/optimizer-helio-g99-malig57 # Single-device Infinix Helio G99 game booster and optimizer; equivalent tuners already covered.
https://github.com/XTOM0706/arix-app # Another on-device voice AI agent with Shizuku shell; equivalent to Operit Mythara OmniBot already listed.
https://github.com/zhyang18/Battery # Another Shizuku battery health monitor; equivalent to BatStats Battery-Monitor and battery-stats-changer listed.
https://github.com/Yizhou147/FrostHush # Hail-derived Shizuku app-suspender for focus sessions; equivalent to Hail DetoxDroid and Curbox with Chinese-dominant docs.
https://github.com/sunO2/GStore # Another GitHub and F-Droid store with Shizuku silent install; Chinese-only and equivalent to Obtainium and AuroraStore.
https://github.com/adybag14-cyber/hermes-agent # Fork of Hermes AI agent; another local AI harness equivalent to listed Operit Mythara and OmniBot.
https://github.com/xnet-admin-1/mcpshell # MCP server exposing sh Ubuntu and rish shells; equivalent to listed rish-mcp with no license or releases.
https://github.com/1zhangyy1/momoding # Local-first share-to-task AI agent with read-only Shizuku inspection; equivalent to listed AI agents.
https://github.com/nastorehub/NasUX # Linux terminal plus bundled NasTech AI agent with optional Shizuku; equivalent to listed AI agents and terminals.
https://github.com/quyetbkhoa/NOBG # Shizuku background freezer and CPU tuner with AI chat; equivalent to KillMyApps shappky and NoMoreBackground with no license or releases.
https://github.com/yzddmr6/PrismSpace # Work-profile dual-space cloner with Shizuku and root modes; equivalent to Island Insular and harbor with Chinese-dominant docs.
https://github.com/pvlmgit/RORA-PREEZE # Shizuku and root app freezer with modes; equivalent to Hail FreezeYou and AppControlX.
https://github.com/shreyagarwal72/switcher5G # 5G SA NSA and LTE switcher via Shizuku hidden telephony APIs; equivalent to FiveGSwitcher NetToggle and NetworkSwitch.
https://github.com/LittleCabbage-00/Toolbox # Material toolbox with crypto browser and Shizuku terminal; Chinese-only with no releases and duplicate toolbox scope.
https://github.com/xohus/cloudcord # Another Discord client mod and installer; equivalent to Aliucord-Manager Kettu and revenge-manager with no license.

